{"unit_id":"ChengChe106__dsh-session-cost#card-zh","repo":"ChengChe106/dsh-session-cost","commit":"a858eaaa116f83e0adbf546ce82c27a91e4d478e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-cost 是面向 DSH Web 的会话费用估算插件。它读取会话的 tokenUsage 投影，在 composer dock 统计区域插入费用行，按 token 数量和 DeepSeek 价格表计算估值，并显示总额以及命中、未命中和输出费用明细。它按北京时间区分高峰与空闲时段，并在新价格生效时间后切换峰谷价格。用户可在会话中查看估算费用；此版本按默认 flash 模型计价，结果仅供参考，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:99-153"]}
{"unit_id":"ChengChe106__dsh-session-cost#card-en","repo":"ChengChe106/dsh-session-cost","commit":"a858eaaa116f83e0adbf546ce82c27a91e4d478e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-cost estimates DeepSeek cost for a DSH Web session. It reads tokenUsage and adds total, cache-hit, cache-miss, and output costs to the composer dock. Beijing peak pricing and the default flash model are used. Estimates may differ from bills; no extra key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:99-153"]}
