{"unit_id":"ChengChe106__dsh-session-cost#feature-1","repo":"ChengChe106/dsh-session-cost","commit":"a858eaaa116f83e0adbf546ce82c27a91e4d478e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-cost 的功能「会话费用估算」：读取 tokenUsage 中的输入、缓存读写和输出 token 数，按内置 DeepSeek 价格计算总费用及分项。客户端在会话统计区域显示估算值。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:46-60","lib/client.js:99-112"]}
{"unit_id":"ChengChe106__dsh-session-cost#feature-2","repo":"ChengChe106/dsh-session-cost","commit":"a858eaaa116f83e0adbf546ce82c27a91e4d478e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-cost 的功能「峰谷价格切换」：根据当前时间和 2026-08-17 生效点选择价格表，并按北京时间的高峰或空闲时段计价。费用按默认 flash 模型估算。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:15-35","lib/client.js:46-51"]}
{"unit_id":"ChengChe106__dsh-session-cost#feature-3","repo":"ChengChe106/dsh-session-cost","commit":"a858eaaa116f83e0adbf546ce82c27a91e4d478e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-cost 的功能「统计栏费用明细」：会话存在计费 token 时，在 composer dock 展示费用总额、命中、未命中和输出四项金额；没有用量时不显示该条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:63-68","lib/client.js:99-139"]}
{"unit_id":"ChengChe106__dsh-session-cost#feature-4","repo":"ChengChe106/dsh-session-cost","commit":"a858eaaa116f83e0adbf546ce82c27a91e4d478e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-cost 的功能「中英文费用文案」：为费用总额及命中、未命中、输出明细注册中文和英文标签，由 DSH locale 服务提供界面文案。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:77-90","lib/client.js:142-153"]}
{"unit_id":"ChengChe106__dsh-session-cost#caveat-1","repo":"ChengChe106/dsh-session-cost","commit":"a858eaaa116f83e0adbf546ce82c27a91e4d478e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-cost 使用默认 flash 模型进行费用估算，缓存写入按未命中价格计；会话中途切换模型不追溯，结果可能与实际账单不同。（见 lib/client.js:27-28、39-44）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:27-28","lib/client.js:37-44"]}
